  <item>
    <title>玄商之道：女性领导者的能量突围之路</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67b320ec606e5c594009261f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67b320ec606e5c594009261f</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 17 Feb 2025 11:44:47 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这期播客我邀请到了资深玄学电商运营管理者Amy，她拥有近十年的电商运营经验，从基层运营一路成长为管理者，带领着二三十人的团队。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在本期节目中，Amy将分享她如何从 0 到 1 打造业绩，赢得老板信任，以及在团队管理、选人用人方面的实战经验。她还将坦诚地分享在面对挑战和困境时，如何调整策略，保持团队活力，并在工作与家庭之间找到平衡。如果你想了解电商运营管理的干货，以及如何打造高效团队，千万不要错过这期精彩的分享！</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> &nbsp;嘉宾介绍及从业经历</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="96">01:36</a> &nbsp;如何用结果赢得老板信任</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="161">02:41</a></span></strong><span> 对自身职业发展的期望和挑战</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="224">03:44</a></span></strong><span> 面对挫败感的调整与应对</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="254">04:14</a></span></strong><span> 如何识别和选择能帮助自己成长的老板</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="329">05:29</a></span></strong><span> 老板的价值观的重要性&nbsp;</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="349">05:49</a></span></strong><span> 人才挖掘：选人的渠道和标准</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="442">07:22</a></span></strong><span>独特的“玄学”面试筛选方法</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="514">08:34</a></span></strong><span> 用人策略：如何激发员工潜力</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="531">08:51</a></span></strong><span> 每日例会的重要性及奖励机制</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="656">10:56</a></span></strong><span> 如何平衡老员工情绪和新人的工作安排</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="672">11:12</a></span></strong><span> 与员工保持距离的必要性</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="810">13:30</a></span></strong><span> 如何管理个性强势、能力强的员工</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="980">16:20</a></span></strong><span> 如何应对失败项目，保持团队士气</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1035">17:15</a></span></strong><span> 业务快速起飞的关键因素</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1173">19:33</a></span></strong><span> 业绩增长缓慢时的复盘方法</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1347">22:27</a></span></strong><span> 新业务启动的朴素办法</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1496">24:56</a> 人效考核标准</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1662">27:42</a></span></strong><span> 如何平衡家庭、工作和自我</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1746">29:06</a></span></strong><span> 如何高质量陪伴孩子</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
